WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.169
Use partial products and place-value columns to multiply by a two-digit or

00:00:05.169 --> 00:00:07.240
three-digit factor. Estimate to check.

00:00:08.117 --> 00:00:18.884
Calculate 2,552 times 47. The answer is 119,944. Use partial products or long

00:00:18.884 --> 00:00:22.197
multiplication to get 119,944.

